{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415766","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415766","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041576601:1":{"text":"잘 들어요, 피파. 이따가 근위대가 오면 저를 못 봤다고 말하는 거예요!","source_cn":"听着，皮帕，如果等会有守备军找了过来，你就说你没看见我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CB575621DD9775D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041576602:1":{"text":"하지만... 거짓말은 나쁜 거잖아요. 게다가 저는 긴, 긴장하기만 하면 말을 더듬으니까, 부, 분명 들키고 말 거예요! 이거 보세요...","source_cn":"可是……撒谎是不对的，而且我只要一紧张，说话就会结结巴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92CE9D834A0F9CD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041576603:1":{"text":"아니면... 마법으로 숨으실래요? 지난번에 벽으로 변신하려 했다가, 춤추는 버섯들이 잔뜩 나와 버리긴 했지만...","source_cn":"要不……我用魔法把我们藏起来？虽然我上次想变一堵墙，结...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49D65279EF718ACF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041576604:1":{"text":"춤추는 버섯? 그거 좋네요! 근위대가 놀라서 달아날 수도 있겠어요!","source_cn":"会跳舞的蘑菇？这不正好吗！说不定能把守备军吓跑呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF0419DEE0F8D47E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041576605:1":{"text":"당신의 마법은 정말 재미있어요. 전 왜 버섯으로 변신할 생각을 못 했을까요?","source_cn":"你的魔法真有意思，我怎么没想到能把我们变成蘑菇呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECFF2D8A25523325","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041576606:1":{"text":"헤헤, 사실 솔리스 교수님도 제 혼돈 마법을 보시고는 가끔 엄청난 영감이 떠오른다고 하셨거든요.","source_cn":"嘿嘿，其实娑丽丝老师也说，我的混沌魔法有时候能带来奇妙...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE824C5F9EFFE208","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041576607:1":{"text":"지난번에는 마법으로 솔방울을 모으려고 했는데, 지팡이에서 엄청난 불꽃이 튀었어요!","source_cn":"就像上次，我本来是想用魔法收集松果，结果魔杖里却蹿出了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC800B21C07BC673E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041576608:1":{"text":"다행히 솔방울이 딱 알맞게 구워졌지 뭐예요!","source_cn":"幸运的是，那些松果被烤得刚刚好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD67E8997385E994","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041576609:1":{"text":"와! 엄청 재밌었겠네요!","source_cn":"哇，这听起来也太刺激了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9C76F83A602C6B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041576610:1":{"text":"피파, 다음에 솔방울을 구울 때는 꼭 저도 데려가 줘요.","source_cn":"皮帕，下次你烤松果的时候一定要带上我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AE80624030473F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041576611:1":{"text":"네? 하지만... 엄청 위험해요. 공주님의 치마를 태우면 어떡하죠?","source_cn":"诶？可是……可是很危险的，要是点燃了你的裙子怎么办？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78B39EFFF38536D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041576612:1":{"text":"뭘 그런 걸 신경 쓰나요? 치마는 갈아입으면 그만인걸요!","source_cn":"那就换一条裙子嘛，这有什么大不了的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20B4C7AEA5AF9820","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041576613:1":{"text":"그 신기한 혼돈 마법을 두 눈으로 직접 보는 것보다 더 멋진 경험이 어디 있겠어요!","source_cn":"能亲眼看到你的混沌魔法的奇妙变化，才是最酷的体验好吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AD27264FE813166","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:佩吉":{"text":"페기","source":"佩吉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:皮帕":{"text":"피파","source":"皮帕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":2}}